[00:25.468]We venture through the cosmic sea
{"我们穿越宇宙之海"}
[00:27.788]A thousand light-years, wild and free
{"千万光年 狂野自由"}
[00:30.715]We dance beneath the galaxy
{"在银河之下起舞"}
[00:32.956]Then will you be with me?
{"你可愿与我同行"}
[00:36.195]Hand in hand, we’ll face our fears
{"携手直面恐惧"}
[00:38.331]Conquering doubts that linger near
{"征服徘徊的疑虑"}
[00:41.235]Together we’ll find a way
{"共同寻找出路"}
[00:43.892]To brighter, better days
{"通往更光明的未来"}
[00:47.173]Exploration, begins!
{"探索，开始！"}
[00:52.680]Moving on, to paths unknown
{"向着未知前进"}
[00:56.968]To break into daylight
{"冲破黎明的界限"}
[00:59.489]No sleep until sunrise
{"不眠直至日出"}
[01:03.136]Riding on, our roads afar
{"驰骋在遥远征途"}
[01:07.648]We’re rising high, into the sky,
{"我们翱翔天际"}
[01:10.064]There we go, till we know
{"前行直至领悟"}
[01:16.648]Exploration
{"探索"}
[01:20.113]
[01:20.529]Exploration begins!
{"探索开始！"}
[01:24.480]Catching on, our paths unknown,
{"踏上未知旅程"}
[01:28.952]To sink into daylight
{"沉入白昼光芒"}
[01:31.736]Break into the moonlight
{"闯入月夜之境"}
[01:35.081]Life goes on, through tides of time
{"生命穿越时光浪潮"}
[01:39.631]Get in the line, to dream alive
{"加入逐梦行列"}
[01:42.048]In our souls, do we know?
{"灵魂深处可知晓"}
